# Screen UI Rules
- In `presentation/screens/**`, keep the file focused on the screen entry composable(s) and screen-level wiring/state only.
- Do not place reusable UI components inside `*Screen.kt` (or other screen files); extract them into a `components/` folder, e.g. `presentation/screens/<screen>/components/**`.
- When extracting, name component files by their purpose (e.g. `TopBar.kt`, `AppRow.kt`) rather than repeating a feature prefix (e.g. avoid `BatchUninstall...` on every file).
- Keep the screen file under ~200 lines; split large UI into multiple component files.

